  "d2 A person, maybe 50s, with a buzz cut is working the cookpot, tasting, adjusting.",
  "d3 Dawn. You wake rested. (+3 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 300 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)",
  "d3 You see smoke on the horizon. Thornfield — 12 people, 3 days in. fishing folk, by the look of it. They know 3 plants — 3 new to you. They've been here the whole time.",
